      {
        "id": 187499,
        "name": "NinjaMonkey",
        "username": "NinjaMonkey",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/67e7ee/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-12-26T16:30:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>NinjaMonkey wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>... one-shotted Iron Legacy ...\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<p>I think of ‘one-shotted’ as meaning destroying a target with a single dealing of damage, but I’m guessing you mean that KNYFE destroyed Iron Legacy on her turn by taking him from max down to 0 HP using a series of attacks. I’m curious what the details were, if you happen to remember.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I’m sorry, I don’t remember the details. We played that game months ago. All I remember was that Legacy(Pauline) was on the team and there was a Meteor Storm out which gave us time to build up. I’m pretty sure I had a Primed Punch already out and pulled off the combo I mentioned earlier leading with a second Primed Punch.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:13:18.411Z",
