      {
        "id": 187502,
        "name": "robb8888",
        "username": "robb8888",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dec6dc/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-03T00:21:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Lots of interesting ideas here; I'll have to try them out. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>One of my biases against KNYFE may come from the fact that for whatever reason, I found myself playing her against Spite numerous times, with no buffing or damage-redirecting heroes to help. &nbsp;Between Spite's DR, KNYFE's lack of DR (which made the \"take damage whenever you use a power\" really problematic), and the continuous ongoing/equipment destruction (so she never got to keep her Blade/Gauntlet/anything else in play very long), she just wasn't doing much good, and was leaking HP like a sieve. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 27,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:13:18.612Z",
