        "created_at": "2017-01-11T06:26:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This week's Weekly One-shot is a good example of KNYFE shining. &nbsp;I got her Kinetic Neutralizer and Conduit Blade out first turn (courtesy of her Rogue Agent Power), and then proceded to deal 5 damage each turn with Primed Punch. &nbsp;And the turn after that Energy Burn did another 9 damage on top of the Primed Punch.</p>",
